From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Soultaco83 <soulnacho@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 30 Jul 2026 00:00:00 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] add-missing-currentPgsRenderer-field-declaration

Add the `#currentPgsRenderer` private field declaration that is referenced
in `#applyAspectRatio` (line 2306) but was never declared in the class body.
Matches the existing pattern used by `#currentAssRenderer` and `#currentBitmapSubRenderer`.

diff --git a/src/plugins/htmlVideoPlayer/plugin.js b/src/plugins/htmlVideoPlayer/plugin.js
index 0000000000..0000000000 100644
--- a/src/plugins/htmlVideoPlayer/plugin.js
+++ b/src/plugins/htmlVideoPlayer/plugin.js
@@ -277,6 +277,10 @@
      * @type {any | null | undefined}
      */
     #currentBitmapSubRenderer;
+    /**
+     * @type {any | null | undefined}
+     */
+    #currentPgsRenderer;
     /**
      * @type {number | undefined}
      */
